            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "r4OEn",
              "name": "Engineering House is a Special Interest House that promotes collaboration and support for engineering students. We build projects for Imagine RIT, create support networks for class work, and promote a strong family atmosphere. Established in 1971, we have a large range of alumni to support us. Currently, Engineering House is located on the top floor of Nathaniel Rochester Hall.",
