                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "6KO9r",
                  "name": "Engineering studies at RIT are demanding, but you will find that you could have a significant advantage by living in Engineering House. We promote team-building and encourage members to work together to accomplish goals. Our theatre area provides everything needed to relax and our workshop is a nice open space to work on what you please. Our strong family atmosphere allows us to work together to complete projects, sponsor events, and participate in many exclusive activities throughout the year, including movie nights, athletic events, intramural sports, house trips, community service, and much more.",
                  "fill": "#ebf2faff",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Engineering studies at RIT are demanding, but you will find that you could have a significant advantage by living in Engineering House. We promote team-building and encourage members to work together to accomplish goals. Our theatre area provides everything needed to relax and our workshop is a nice open space to work on what you please.\n\nOur strong family atmosphere allows us to work together to complete projects, sponsor events, and participate in many exclusive activities throughout the year, including movie nights, athletic events, intramural sports, house trips, community service, and much more.",
