            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "0ktK2",
              "name": "Every year, RIT hosts ImagineRIT, a festival to showcase the innovative and creative spirit of RIT students, faculty and staff. Engineering House consistently participates in the festival, getting together in groups to create projects that combine engineering skills and ingenuity.",
